Gust summons a powerful blast of wind to buffet an opponent. While the
damage is modest, the real value lies in the spell's ability to knock
enemies off their feet, leaving them dazed and vulnerable.

A critical success creates a particularly violent gust that lifts the
victim into the air before slamming them to the ground, causing additional
disorientation. Even a normal success can leave the target sitting on
the ground, giving you precious time to follow up with more powerful
attacks.

This spell cannot be cast underwater, as there is insufficient air to
manipulate in such environments.

